# ~/.claude is a real folder on both machines; stow links only the entries in
# this package (and claude-mac/ or claude-linux/) into it. Should ~/.claude ever
# be a folder symlink into this repo again, Claude Code writes ALL of its
# runtime state (session transcripts, caches, logs, plugins, telemetry, auth
# tokens) here. Ignore everything by default and whitelist only the real,
# portable config worth version-controlling.
#
# NOTE: never un-ignore projects/, backups/, daemon/, history.jsonl or *.claude.json*
# — they contain credentials and confidential work-session data.

*

# --- Portable config to keep ---
!.gitignore
!settings.json
!CLAUDE.md
!RTK.md

# Authored agents / skills / commands (must re-include the dir, then its contents)
!agents/
!agents/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**

# Personal mods, served as the local marketplace "lars-mods" (engine-generated types stay out)
!mods/
!mods/**
mods/*/.claude-plugin/types/

# Never in this (public) repo: org-synced skills and work-internal skills carry
# confidential Norsk Rikstoto material; .trash is just deleted-skill copies.
skills/synced/
skills/.trash/
skills/rikstoto-delegate/
